  auction 1206 x10

step Engineering 105-135: bars and gems
  tip Bronze Bar is smelted from a Copper Bar and a Tin Bar (Mining 65); Moss Agate turns up in Tin and Silver Veins. Gather them while you level, or take them from your bank.
  collect 2841 x50 anywhere gather Mining 65
  collect 1206 x10 anywhere gather Mining 65

step Engineering 105-135: vendor goods
  tip Weak Flux comes from Engineering supply vendors near the trainer.
  buy 2880 x25 nearest

step Bronze Tube, Standard Scope (105-135)
  tip Bronze Tube, 25 crafts to 125: two Bronze Bars and a Weak Flux each. Keep 10 of them for the scopes. If you come up a few points short of 125, do not make more tubes: start the scopes. Then Standard Scope, 10 crafts to 135: a kept tube and a Moss Agate each. If Moss Agate is missing or very expensive, skip the scopes and start the Heavy Blasting Powder instead.
  learn 3938 "Bronze Tube"
  craft 3938 "Bronze Tube" until 125
  learn 3978 "Standard Scope"
  craft 3978 "Standard Scope" until 135

