step Expert Mining
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Expert Mining raises the cap to 225 and needs skill 125 (it costs 50 silver at the trainer). Geofram Bouldertoe in Ironforge teaches it, so visit him right after the Engineering trainer.
  train Mining Expert npc 4254

step Expert Mining
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Expert Mining raises the cap to 225 and needs skill 125 (it costs 50 silver at the trainer). Makaru in Orgrimmar teaches it, so visit him right after the Engineering trainer.
  train Mining Expert npc 3357

step Iron and Gold in Arathi Highlands
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Mine up to Mining 155: Iron Deposits need 125 and Gold Veins need 155. This is the Forever Bauxite window: Gold Veins, Mithril Deposits and Indurium veins sometimes give a Bauxite as a bonus drop, so never skip a Gold Vein, and save every Bauxite you see for Sandpaper. Heavy Stone comes from Iron Deposits. Arathi has caves worth entering fully; low-level characters should stay outside or work Thousand Needles instead.
  goto 19.2,93.3 "Tin Vein, Gold Vein" r 30
  goto 28.4,88.2 "Tin Vein, Gold Vein" r 30
  goto 26.8,69.6 "Tin Vein, Gold Vein" r 30
  goto 15.8,63.2 "Tin Vein, Iron Deposit" r 30
  goto 17.3,47.7 "Tin Vein, Iron Deposit" r 30
  skill Mining 155

step Engineering 135-160: Auction House
  tip What the sheep parts take that the Auction House sells: 30 Heavy Stone, 60 Bronze Bar, 30 Wool Cloth, 15 Medium Leather. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 2838 x30
  auction 2841 x60
  auction 2592 x30
  auction 2319 x15

step Engineering 135-160: stone, bars, cloth and leather
  tip Heavy Stone comes from Iron Deposits while mining; Bronze Bar is smelted from a Copper Bar and a Tin Bar; Wool Cloth drops from humanoids of level 15-30; Medium Leather is skinned from beasts in the 15-30 zones. Gather them while you level, or take them from your bank.
  collect 2838 x30 anywhere gather Mining 125
  collect 2841 x60 anywhere gather Mining 65
  collect 2592 x30 anywhere gather levels 15-30
  collect 2319 x15 anywhere gather Skinning 100

step Sandpaper: Auction House
  tip Optional Forever scarce step. Sandpaper is two Bauxite and a Bolt of Linen Cloth. If you did not find Bauxite while mining Gold Veins, buy it here, or skip this step and come back when your bank holds some.
  auction 249425 x10
  auction 2996 x5

step Sandpaper: Bauxite
  tip Bauxite is a scarce bonus drop from Gold Veins, Mithril Deposits and Indurium veins, so it arrives one at a time while you mine. Keep every piece.
  collect 249425 x10 anywhere gather Mining 155

step Sandpaper (Engineering 130)
  tip Sandpaper unlocks at Engineering 130 and gives skill points until about 155. Make 5: two Bauxite and a Bolt of Linen Cloth each. Hold them for Blacksmithing alts or the Auction House: 25 Blacksmithing recipes use them, so they sell well. A Bolt of Linen Cloth is two Linen Cloth woven at a tailor, or buy them.
  learn 1249634 "Sandpaper"
  craft 1249634 "Sandpaper" x5

step Heavy Blasting Powder, Whirring Bronze Gizmo, Bronze Framework (135-160)
  tip In this order. Heavy Blasting Powder, 30 crafts: one Heavy Stone each, keep them all for the sheep. Then Whirring Bronze Gizmo, 15 crafts to 150: two Bronze Bars and a Wool Cloth each, keep them all. Then Bronze Framework, 15 crafts to 160: two Bronze Bars, a Medium Leather and a Wool Cloth each, keep them all. The frameworks will probably carry you past 160; if they do not, make a few more, the sheep only need 15.
  learn 3945 "Heavy Blasting Powder"
  craft 3945 "Heavy Blasting Powder" x30
  learn 3942 "Whirring Bronze Gizmo"
  craft 3942 "Whirring Bronze Gizmo" until 150
  learn 3953 "Bronze Framework"
  craft 3953 "Bronze Framework" until 160

section Engineering 160-175

