  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Finish Mining 175 before the Solid Stone band: Mithril Deposits open at 175. Gold Veins and Iron Deposits keep giving points on the way, and Gold Veins can still drop Bauxite. If the prices suit you, Smelt Gold from 155 takes you up toward 175 on roughly 22 Gold Ore.
