step Unstable Trigger, Mithril Casing (200-238)
  tip Unstable Trigger, 20 crafts to 215: a Mithril Bar, a Mageweave Cloth and one of the kept Solid Blasting Powders each. Keep all 20 for the bombs. Then Mithril Casing, 40 crafts to 238: three Mithril Bars each. Keep all 40 for the bombs.
  learn 12591 "Unstable Trigger"
  craft 12591 "Unstable Trigger" until 215
  learn 12599 "Mithril Casing"
  craft 12599 "Mithril Casing" until 238

section Engineering 238-260

step Small Thorium in Un'Goro Crater
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Small Thorium Veins need Mining 245 and are where Dense Stone starts. Mine to Mining 275 here; the two marked caves hold two or three veins each, and lower levels usually skip the south cave. Felwood is the alternative: its marked cave is small and quiet, and the Jaedenar caves, Shadow Hold especially, are best skipped unless you can stealth.
