  tip What the next powder takes that the Auction House sells: 88 Dense Stone. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 12365 x88

step Engineering 238-260: stone
  tip Dense Stone comes from Thorium Veins while mining. Pick it up as you level, or take it from your bank.
